      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "77 patients with consequences of past closed craniocerebral trauma have been observed. The observation included using specially developed questionnaires for patients, medical history collection, detailed neurological examination and neurovisual test (brain MRT). It was not found reliable correlation between expression of changes in structure of the brain tissue, liquor tracts, arachnoid space and syndromological peculiarities, intensity of asthenic syndrome."},
